# PROPOSAL 1 — FULL PLATFORM
## AAAH Enterprise AI Platform — On-Premise Deployment
### Proof of Concept (PoC)

---

**Prepared by:** Spark Technologies
**Prepared for:** AAAH Holding Corp
**Date:** September 1, 2026
**PoC Timeline:** 6 Weeks

