## 1. Overview

Spark Technologies is proposing to deploy the **AAAH Enterprise AI Platform** directly at AAAH Holding Corp's premises — meaning all data stays within your own infrastructure, with no dependency on any external cloud service.

The platform brings together eight AI-powered tools into one unified system, covering everything from reading and drafting documents, to analysing drawings, tracking site progress, and detecting clashes in building models.

This document outlines:
- The physical equipment needed to run the platform
- What data and access AAAH Holding Corp will need to provide
- How the system can grow as your needs expand

> **PoC Scope:** 1–2 active project sites, up to 100 users, 10 users running AI features at the same time.

---

## 2. What the Platform Does

| Module | What It Does |
|---|---|
| **Executive Dashboard** | A live summary of all project KPIs, progress curves, and activity across all modules |
| **Drawing Scanner & BOQ** | Reads CAD drawings automatically and generates quantity take-offs |
| **Document OCR & Parsing** | Extracts key information from invoices, contracts, and purchase orders |
| **Document Drafting** | Drafts contracts, NOCs, and RFIs using AI, ready for review and approval |
| **Clash Detection** | Identifies conflicts between different building models (e.g. structure vs. MEP) |
| **Site Monitoring** | Connects to your existing site cameras to detect safety issues and track progress |
| **DMS & AI Assistant** | A searchable document library with an AI assistant that answers questions from your files |
| **Progress Monitoring** | Tracks planned vs actual progress, updates WBS activities, and flags delays automatically |

