### 3.4 Built to Grow

The server is designed so that additional AI processing cards can be added later — **without replacing the machine itself**. The PoC starts with 2 cards, and the server can hold up to 4.

| Stage | AI Cards | Users Supported |
|---|---|---|
| **PoC (Now)** | 2 cards | 100 users, 10 simultaneous AI |
| **Phase 2** | 3 cards | ~150 users, 20 simultaneous AI |
| **Full Scale** | 4 cards | 200+ users, 35+ simultaneous AI |

> Adding a card in the future costs approximately **AED 46,200** and requires no new server.

