## 7. Drone Integration — Optional

The Progress Monitoring module is built to work with drone surveys as an optional add-on. It is not required for the PoC, but can be switched on at any time.

| | Without Drone | With Drone |
|---|---|---|
| **How progress is measured** | AI reads your existing cameras | AI also processes aerial drone images |
| **Accuracy** | Good (~65–70%) | Very High (~90–95%) |
| **Comparison against building model** | Not available | Available — AI compares what is built vs what was designed |
| **Extra hardware needed** | None | Drone flights (third-party service, hired separately) |

> Drone flights can be arranged by AAAH as a third-party service. No changes to the server or platform are needed to enable this.

